WEBVTT
# Subtitles for Star Catcher EP2

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:08.800
The machine opens its eye beneath the tide.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.500
Nobody is home... and yet.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.500
Falling past the roots of the stone pillars.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.000
How far down does a drowned sky go?

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.000
A river of amber embers in the trench.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:08.800
The lanterns that went out in Episode One... never went out.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:03.000
We cast the net at the abyss lures. They were never monsters.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.500
They were stars, caged.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.500
Every submerged rope relit.

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:33.000
A new heart is not the old one... but it beats anyway.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:48.000
The mirror gives them back as constellations.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.500
And in the black sky...

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.800
...a door.
